  "description": "The steady-state screen events (C4 decision 9): screen_change names the output seq that caused it, with change one of alt_enter (CSI ?1049h), alt_exit (CSI ?1049l) and clear (ED 2/ED 3) — the input snapshot.on_alt_screen needs (immortality §5.2). They are small events, and steady state carries only them, honouring open_decisions §1's 'ship deltas, not full snapshots'. After hello and the grid's open, the core feeds frames whose seqs the events carry; each screen_change is a small event, not answered. Graded by the U4 worker (owed) and the U2 core (owed).",
  "corpus": [
    "plan.md C4 decision 3",
    "plan.md C4 decision 9",
    "vt-ipc.schema.json screen_change"
  ],
  "case": {
